msgstr "haipo — sahihi ya GPG imezimwa"

#: qt/metadata.py:67
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Source: {url}\n"
"Suggested name: {name}\n"
"Descriptor: {descriptor}\n"
"SHA-256 of the provided key: {fingerprint}\n"
"HTTPS protects the transport; it does not guarantee that this source is "
"trustworthy. Adding the source changes the Flatpak configuration now. It may "
"remain even if the installation is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Chanzo: {url}\n"
"Jina linalopendekezwa: {name}\n"
"Kielezi: {descriptor}\n"
"SHA-256 ya ufunguo uliotolewa: {fingerprint}\n"
"HTTPS hulinda usafirishaji; haihakikishi kwamba chanzo hiki kinaaminika. "
"Kuongeza chanzo hubadilisha usanidi wa Flatpak sasa hivi. Huenda ukabaki "
"hata kama usakinishaji utaghairiwa."

